  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Sudan - Peacebuilding Opportunities Fund 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">POF2 is the second phase of the South Sudan Peacebuilding Opportunities Fund programme. POF1 was implemented from 2019 to 2023. POF2 will support communities, including women, youth and other marginalised groups, in target conflict areas &#x2013; currently Lakes State, Jonglei State and Greater Pibor Administrative Area (GPAA), with the possibility of expansion to new areas. POF2 will manage, reduce, and prevent violent conflict in inclusive and sustainable ways. The programme includes support to livelihood activities, as well as a capacity building workstream to develop national NGOs so that they become capable of securing direct FCDO and other donor funding in the future.</narrative>
  </description>
